                                                            </div>
                                                                                                                    <div class="panel panel-default card">
                                                                <div class="p-heading"><a href="#question2" data-parent="#accordion2" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                                                                          aria-expanded="false" class="collapsed">Which segment accounted for the largest U.S. household vacuum cleaner market share?</a>
                                                                </div>
                                                                <div class="panel-collapse collapse " id="question2" aria-expanded="false" style="">
                                                                    <div class="panel-body card-body">
                                                                        <p class="m-faq-ans"><span></span>The canister segment dominated the U.S. household vacuum cleaner market with a share of over 25% in 2024. This is attributable to the factors such as the growing focus on compact and lightweight designs to cater to smaller urban homes and growing demand for models with retractable cords and built-in storage for accessories.</p>
                                                                    </div>
                                                                </div>
                                                            </div>
                                                                                                                    <div class="panel panel-default card">
