                                                                    <div class="panel-body card-body">
                                                                        <p class="m-faq-ans"><span></span>Some key players operating in the U.S. household vacuum cleaner market include iRobot Corporation, Xiaomi, Beijing Roborock Technology Co., Ltd. (Roborock), SharkNinja Operating LLC, Neato Robotics, Inc., Panasonic Corporation, Samsung Electronics Co., Ltd., Dyson, Ecovacs Robotics Co., Ltd., LG Electronics Inc.</p>
