                                                                <div class="p-heading"><a href="#question4" data-parent="#accordion2" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                                                                                          aria-expanded="false" class="collapsed">What are the factors driving the U.S. household vacuum cleaner market?</a>
                                                                </div>
                                                                <div class="panel-collapse collapse " id="question4" aria-expanded="false" style="">
                                                                    <div class="panel-body card-body">
                                                                        <p class="m-faq-ans"><span></span>The significant growth of the U.S. household vacuum cleaner market is attributed to technological advancements, changing consumer preferences, evolving market dynamics and the growing popularity of vacuums that provide powerful suction, advanced filtration, and longer lifespans, and the shift toward smarter, more efficient, and user-friendly devices.</p>
