    <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #57534e; line-height: 1.75; margin: 0;">This report was authored by the next generation technologies research team at Grand View Research - comprising two research analysts, one senior research analyst, and one industry expert - with specialized expertise in the next generation technologies segment of the technology industry. All findings are based on proprietary technology databases, executive interviews, and regulatory analysis, subject to internal peer review prior to publication.</p>
    
